  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 221 * 17 * 3 * 60 * 7 * 10.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷, –, +, =, ×**\n\nGiven: 221 * 17 * 3 * 60 * 7 * 10\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**221 ÷ 17**__ - 3 + 60 = 7 × 10\n\n⇒ 13 - 3 + 60 = __**7 × 10**__\n\n⇒ __**13**__ - 3 __**+ 60 **__= 70\n\n⇒ __73 - 3__ = 70 \n\n⇒ **70 = 70**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) +, =, ×, ÷, –\n\nGiven: 221 * 17 * 3 * 60 * 7 * 10\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 221 + 17 = __**3 × 60 ÷ 7**__ - 10\n\n⇒ __**221 +**____** 17**__ = __**25.71 - 10**__\n\n⇒ 238 ≠ 15.71\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷, ×, +, =, +\n\nGiven: 221 * 17 * 3 * 60 * 7 * 10\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**221 ÷ 17**__ × 3 + 60 = 7 + 10\n\n⇒ __**13**____** × 3**__ + 60 = 7 + 10 \n\n⇒ __**39 **____**+ 60**__ = __**7 + 10**____** **__\n\n⇒ 99 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) +, =, ×, +, ×\n\nGiven: 221 * 17 * 3 * 60 * 7 * 10\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 221 + 17 = __**3 × 60**__ + __**7 × 10**__\n\n⇒ __**221 + 17**__ = __180____** + **____70__\n\n⇒ 238 ≠ 250\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
